# 🕸️ Web Scraping with Python

A simple and beginner-friendly project demonstrating how to scrape data from websites using **Requests** and **BeautifulSoup**.  
This project is suitable for Data Science students, automation beginners, or anyone who wants to extract data from the web.

---

## ⭐ Features
- Fetch HTML from websites  
- Parse pages using BeautifulSoup  
- Extract text, links, and content using classes/IDs  
- Save data into CSV  
- Organized folder structure  
- Beginner-friendly code  

