## 🚀 How to Run

### **1. Run Basic Scraper**
```bash
python src/basic_scraper.py
```

### **basic_scraper.py Example**
```python
import requests
from bs4 import BeautifulSoup
import pandas as pd

url = "https://example.com"

response = requests.get(url)
soup = BeautifulSoup(response.text, 'html.parser')

titles = soup.find_all("h2")

data = [t.text.strip() for t in titles]

df = pd.DataFrame({"Title": data})
df.to_csv("../data/output.csv", index=False)

print("Scraping complete! Saved to data/output.csv")
```

---

## 🔍 How to Customize Scraping
To extract elements with a class:

```python
soup.find_all("div", class_="product-name")
```

Extract links:

```python
link.get("href")
```

